abstract: >-
  Static project page and interactive simulator accompanying Singh & Lohani
  (2026), Modeling Point Cloud Distortions in Mobile Laser Scanning for
  Surveying, Journal of Surveying Engineering 152(3), 04026006. It implements
  the paper's closed-form equations for how motion distorts a scanned moving
  object (length and orientation) next to an independent scan simulation in
  2D and 3D, with field examples from a StreetMapper-V survey (two RIEGL
  VQ-450 scanners), Guwahati. Live page: https://amanks-20.github.io/mls-distortions
